versified beyond oil and gold, reducing the reliance on major commodities and indicating economic resilience.^It highlights strong sectors that contribute significantly to the economy and identifies areas needing policy intervention for growth.^This data reflects how integrated a country is in the global supply chain for various non-oil and non-gold commodities, indicating its role in global trade.^High non-oil and non-gold exports, especially in technology or advanced manufacturing, suggest a competitive edge and innovation in the global market.^This metric helps assess how global trends, such as technological changes or shifts in consumer demand, impact a country’s non-oil sectors."},{"question":"How to interpret the Non-Oil Exports data?","answer":"$2c"}],"related":[{"slug":"10y-g-sec-yield","title":"10Y G-Sec Yield"},{"slug":"current-account-deficit-gdp","title":"Current Account Deficit (% GDP)"},{"slug":"gold-price","title":"Gold Price"},{"slug":"government-consumption-gfce","title":"Government Consumption (GFCE)"},{"slug":"gross-fixed-capital-formation-gfcf","title":"Gross Fixed Capital Formation (GFCF)"},{"slug":"gross-value-added-gva-agriculture","title":"Gross Value Added (GVA) - Agriculture"},{"slug":"gross-value-added-gva-financial-services-real-estate-and-business-services","title":"Gross Value Added (GVA) - Financial, Real Estate and Business Services"},{"slug":"gross-value-added-gva-industry","title":"Gross Value Added (GVA) - Industry"},{"slug":"gross-value-added-gva-overall","title":"Gross Value Added (GVA)- Overall"},{"slug":"gross-value-added-gva-services","title":"Gross Value Added (GVA) - Services"},{"slug":"index-of-industrial-production-iip-8-core-industries","title":"Index of Industrial Production (IIP)- 8 Core Industries"},{"slug":"index-of-industrial-production-iip-overall","title":"Index of Industrial Production (IIP)- Overall"},{"slug":"merchandise-trade-balance","title":"Merchandise Trade Balance"},{"slug":"nifty-50","title":"NIFTY 50"},{